kinney-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Kinney County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 21% of normal in February to March and 27% in August to September. Grid 11217 had its driest year in 1956 at 26% of normal.</p>"}
